title
  Combat Robot Archetype Simulator

subtitle
  Randomized Robot Wars-style dossiers for concept design and inspiration.

adjective
  Iron
  Titan
  Viper
  Atlas
  Razor
  Ember
  Nova
  Aegis
  Rift
  Granite
  Volt
  Onyx

noun
  Fang
  Bastion
  Reaper
  Forge
  Kraken
  Warden
  Pulse
  Talon
  Hydra
  Sentinel
  Mantis
  Breaker

roman
  I
  II
  III
  IV
  V
  VI
  VII
  VIII
  IX
  X

archetype
  flipper
  crusher
  vertical spinner
  horizontal spinner
  drum spinner
  lifter
  wedge
  control bot
  rammer
  axe bot

sizeClass
  lightweight
  middleweight
  heavyweight

drivetrain
  dual-motor skid steer
  four-motor tank drive
  belt-linked drive train
  high-torque twin gearbox drive
  compact differential drive

weapon
  high-pressure flipper
  hydraulic crusher
  armored vertical spinner
  long-bar horizontal spinner
  high-speed drum
  lifting fork system
  overhead axe
  reinforced wedge and forks
  pneumatic rammer
  synchronized saw arm

armor
  Hardox front wedge
  layered steel shell
  titanium nose plate
  anti-spinner forks
  sacrificial bolt-on armor
  aluminum-and-steel composite shell
  reinforced front ram plate

feature
  self-righting mechanism
  modular front end
  protected electronics pod
  weapon lock pin
  redundant receiver failsafe
  quick-swap armor package
  isolated battery bay
  shock-mounted control tray

weakness
  exposed top armor
  vulnerable side pods
  complex maintenance requirements
  slower recharge cycle
  limited pushing power
  poor rear defense
  sensitive drivetrain alignment
  high recoil stress

coreStat
  aggression
  control
  durability
  damage
  reliability
  mobility

statValue
  1
  2
  3
  4
  5

statBlock
  Aggression: [statValue]
  Control: [statValue]
  Durability: [statValue]
  Damage: [statValue]
  Reliability: [statValue]
  Mobility: [statValue]

robot_name
  [adjective] [noun] [roman]

weapon_role
  [weapon]

build_notes
  [robot_name] is a [sizeClass] [archetype] built around [weapon_role].
  It uses [drivetrain] and carries [armor].
  Signature feature: [feature].
  Likely weakness: [weakness].

dossier
  <div class="card">
    <h2>[robot_name]</h2>
    <p class="subtitle">[sizeClass] • [archetype]</p>
    <div class="grid">
      <div><span>Weapon</span><strong>[weapon]</strong></div>
      <div><span>Armor</span><strong>[armor]</strong></div>
      <div><span>Drive</span><strong>[drivetrain]</strong></div>
      <div><span>Feature</span><strong>[feature]</strong></div>
      <div><span>Weakness</span><strong>[weakness]</strong></div>
      <div><span>Stats</span><strong>[statBlock]</strong></div>
    </div>
  </div>

output
  [dossier]